@host = https://localhost:55076

### 1. Start et øvesæt (noter attemptId fra svaret)
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-sets/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "topicId": 1
}

### 2. Afslut forsøget — forventet 204
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-sets/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attemptId": 1
}

### 3. Afslut samme forsøg igen — forventet 400
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-sets/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attemptId": 1
}

### 4. Forsøg der ikke findes — forventet 404
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-sets/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attemptId": 99999
}

### 5. Ugyldigt input — forventet 400 fra validatoren
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-sets/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attemptId": 0
}

### 6. Start igen på samme emne — forventet et ANDET øvesæt
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-sets/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "topicId": 1
}

### A. Rigtigt svar på øvelse 1 — forventet 200
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-sets/submit-answer
Content-Type: application/json

{ "attemptId": 2, "exerciseId": 1, "answer": "15" }

### B. GUARD 1: samme øvelse igen — forventet 400 "already been answered"
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-sets/submit-answer
Content-Type: application/json

{ "attemptId": 2, "exerciseId": 1, "answer": "99" }

### C. Decimaler og mellemrum på øvelse 2 — forventet 200 og IsCorrect = true
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-sets/submit-answer
Content-Type: application/json

{ "attemptId": 2, "exerciseId": 2, "answer": "  320,00  " }

### D. Punktum — forventet 400 med besked om komma
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-sets/submit-answer
Content-Type: application/json

{ "attemptId": 2, "exerciseId": 1, "answer": "1.5" }

### E. Ikke et tal — forventet 400
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-sets/submit-answer
Content-Type: application/json

{ "attemptId": 2, "exerciseId": 1, "answer": "femten" }

### F. Afslut forsøget — forventet 204
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-sets/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{ "attemptId": 2 }

### G. GUARD 3: svar efter afslutning — forventet 400 "already completed"
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-sets/submit-answer
Content-Type: application/json

{ "attemptId": 2, "exerciseId": 2, "answer": "320" }